{"updatedAt":"2026-10-30T02:35:37.056Z","months":["202411","202412","202501","202502","202503","202504","202505","202506","202507","202508","202509","202510","202511","202512","202601","202602","202603","202604","202605","202606"],"seoul":{"deals":125127,"cancelled":1702,"cancelledShare":1.4,"settleDays":119,"timing":{"counted":1778,"medianDays":32,"withinFilingWindow":48.4,"overQuarter":11.1},"standing":{"compared":1663,"higher":393,"similar":456,"lower":814,"higherShare":23.6,"similarShare":27.4,"lowerShare":48.9,"medianRatio":0.981},"registration":{"medianDays":81,"latestMature":{"month":"2026-04","staleShareOfStale":68,"staleShareWithout":0.7},"byPrice":{"upTo6":{"days":62,"n":20988},"upTo15":{"days":82,"n":59803},"upTo25":{"days":91,"n":18064},"over25":{"days":92,"n":8019}},"registered":106874,"matureMonths":["2024-11","2024-12","2025-01","2025-02","2025-03","2025-04","2025-05","2025-06","2025-07","2025-08","2025-09","2025-10","2025-11","2025-12","2026-01","2026-02","2026-03","2026-04"],"matured":109207,"stale":2282,"staleShare":2.1},"correction":{"reported":8317,"corrections":6531,"share":78.5,"matured":6060,"registeredShare":99.1},"leadKo":"2024.11~2026.06 신고된 매매 125,127건 가운데 1,702건이 나중에 해제됐다. 1.4%다. 절반은 32일 안에 지워졌다 — 신고 기한 30일을 조금 넘긴 때다. 흔히 말하는 것과 달리 해제 거래가 그 단지 최고가인 것은 아니다 — 같은 단지 같은 면적에 남은 거래의 중간값보다 높았던 것이 23.6%인 반면, 낮았던 것이 48.9%로 오히려 더 많다.","leadEn":"Of 125,127 filed sales in 2024.11~2026.06, 1,702 were later cancelled — 1.4%. Half of them were undone within 32 days, just past the 30-day filing window. They are not the top prints people assume: 23.6% sat above the median of what remained in the same complex and floor area, while 48.9% sat below.","correctionLead":{"ko":"해제 신고 8,317건 가운데 6,531건(78.5%)은 같은 계약 기록이 해제 표시 없이 다시 있어, 신고를 고쳐 쓴 것으로 보고 해제에서 뺍니다. 신고 사유는 공개되지 않아 기록이 같다는 것까지만 확인한 것입니다. 등기할 시간이 지난 달만 보면 그 다시 신고된 계약의 99.1%가 등기까지 마쳤습니다. 이 화면의 해제 숫자는 모두 이것을 빼고 셉니다.","en":"Of 8,317 cancellation filings, 6,531 (78.5%) have the same contract record appearing again without a cancelled mark, so they are treated as corrected filings and left out of the cancellation count. The reason for a filing is not published; only that the records match is verified. In months old enough to have registered, 99.1% of those re-filed contracts went on to registration. Every cancellation figure on this page is counted without them."},"registrationLead":{"ko":"익은 달의 계약만 놓고 보면 계약에서 등기까지 절반이 81일 안에 끝났습니다(6억 이하 62일, 6억~15억 82일, 15억~25억 91일, 25억 넘으면 92일). 등기는 잔금을 치른 뒤에 하므로, 대략 계약에서 잔금까지 그만큼 잡는다는 뜻입니다. 익은 달의 계약 109,207건 가운데 2,282건(2.1%)이 아직 등기를 마치지 않았습니다. 다만 그 미등기의 68%가 막 익은 2026년 4월 한 달에서 나옵니다 — 그 달을 빼면 0.7%입니다.","en":"Counting only matured months, half of all deals were registered within 81 days of signing (up to ₩600M 62 days, ₩0.6–1.5B 82 days, ₩1.5–2.5B 91 days, above ₩2.5B 92 days). Registration follows the final payment, so this is roughly how long the gap between contract and final payment runs. Of the 109,207 deals in matured months, 2,282 (2.1%) are still unregistered. Most of those (68%) come from 2026-04, a month that has only just matured; without it the share is 0.7%."}},"priceBands":{"settleDays":119,"months":["202411","202412","202501","202502","202503","202504","202505","202506","202507","202508","202509","202510","202511","202512","202601","202602","202603","202604","202605","202606"],"deals":125127,"rows":[{"key":"upTo6","ko":"6억 이하","en":"up to ₩600M","n":24849,"rate":1.7,"withinMonth":0.4},{"key":"upTo9","ko":"6억~9억","en":"₩600–900M","n":30168,"rate":1.2,"withinMonth":-0.11},{"key":"upTo15","ko":"9억~15억","en":"₩0.9–1.5B","n":39052,"rate":1.1,"withinMonth":-0.23},{"key":"upTo25","ko":"15억~25억","en":"₩1.5–2.5B","n":21324,"rate":1.3,"withinMonth":-0.09},{"key":"over25","ko":"25억 초과","en":"above ₩2.5B","n":9734,"rate":1.8,"withinMonth":0.41}],"gap":{"point":0,"low":-0.26,"high":0.26},"lead":{"ko":"해제가 다 쌓인 계약월(해제의 95%가 계약 뒤 119일 안에 일어난다 — 2024년 11월~2026년 6월)만 놓고 보면, 6억 이하 계약은 1.7%, 25억 초과는 1.8%가 해제됐습니다. 같은 달 안에서만 견주면 차이가 0%p(90% -0.26~0.26%p)로 0을 품습니다 — 가격대로 갈리지 않습니다.","en":"Counting only contract months where cancellations have settled (95% of cancellations come within 119 days; Nov 2024~Jun 2026), 1.7% of deals up to ₩600M and 1.8% of deals above ₩2.5B were cancelled. Comparing within the same months only, the gap is 0pp (90% -0.26 to 0.26pp), which includes zero — price band does not separate them."},"table":{"ko":"<thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">가격대</th><th scope=\"col\">계약</th><th scope=\"col\">해제율</th><th scope=\"col\">같은 달 대비</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>6억 이하</td><td>24,849</td><td>1.7%</td><td>+0.4%p</td></tr><tr><td>6억~9억</td><td>30,168</td><td>1.2%</td><td>-0.11%p</td></tr><tr><td>9억~15억</td><td>39,052</td><td>1.1%</td><td>-0.23%p</td></tr><tr><td>15억~25억</td><td>21,324</td><td>1.3%</td><td>-0.09%p</td></tr><tr><td>25억 초과</td><td>9,734</td><td>1.8%</td><td>+0.41%p</td></tr></tbody>","en":"<thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Price band</th><th scope=\"col\">Deals</th><th scope=\"col\">Cancelled</th><th scope=\"col\">vs same month</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>up to ₩600M</td><td>24,849</td><td>1.7%</td><td>+0.4pp</td></tr><tr><td>₩600–900M</td><td>30,168</td><td>1.2%</td><td>-0.11pp</td></tr><tr><td>₩0.9–1.5B</td><td>39,052</td><td>1.1%</td><td>-0.23pp</td></tr><tr><td>₩1.5–2.5B</td><td>21,324</td><td>1.3%</td><td>-0.09pp</td></tr><tr><td>above ₩2.5B</td><td>9,734</td><td>1.8%</td><td>+0.41pp</td></tr></tbody>"}},"slugs":{"종로구":"jongno","중구":"jung","용산구":"yongsan","성동구":"seongdong","광진구":"gwangjin","동대문구":"dongdaemun","중랑구":"jungnang","성북구":"seongbuk","강북구":"gangbuk","도봉구":"dobong","노원구":"nowon","은평구":"eunpyeong","서대문구":"seodaemun","마포구":"mapo","양천구":"yangcheon","강서구":"gangseo","구로구":"guro","금천구":"geumcheon","영등포구":"yeongdeungpo","동작구":"dongjak","관악구":"gwanak","서초구":"seocho","강남구":"gangnam","송파구":"songpa","강동구":"gangdong"},"districts":[{"district":"용산구","deals":2233,"cancelled":50,"cancelledShare":2.2,"matured":1960,"stale":45,"staleShare":2.3},{"district":"강남구","deals":6057,"cancelle